0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 64.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 15 TL (Manually aggregating this data in spreadsheets is slow, error-prone, and doesn't scale as transaction) Tj T* (volume grows. Existing off-the-shelf dashboard tools are often expensive or overly generic, not tailored) Tj T* (to a specific retail business's product hierarchy or reporting needs. This project addresses that gap by) Tj T* (building a purpose-built sales dashboard, backed by a proper SQL data pipeline, that surfaces) Tj T* (top-performing products and categories at a glance.) Tj T* ET
